    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλᾰν-άομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wander about</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρήτην</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.151
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>float round about</i> one, as the lion's
			skin round Heracles, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				6(5).47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>wander</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				47.21
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα π</span>.
				<i>to be in</i> this state of <i>uncertainty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλανᾶσθαι τὸν αὐλικὸν . .
					ᾑρημένον βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ind.Sto.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπεπλανημένα μέτρα</span>
			<i>erratic, irregular</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				50
			</span></i>.</div>
